  "provenance": [
    "Bass MIDI retained unchanged. Independent score inspection by VerS: https://s9.imslp.org/files/imglnks/usimg/4/42/IMSLP405834-PMLP08710-DvorakSymph9.pdf PDF page 29 (printed 207), Largo bar 5, writes double-bass D-flat4, sounding D-flat3 (MIDI49), in sounding unison with the cello. The source bass_8 clef and low E1 elsewhere must not receive the separate Beethoven source’s blanket -12 correction. This is notation inspection, not aural review.",
